{"id":48211,"date":"2026-01-21T08:02:34","date_gmt":"2026-01-21T07:02:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=48211"},"modified":"2026-09-27T23:50:27","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T22:50:27","slug":"azores-bravos-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/azores-bravos-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Azores Bravos Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Azores Bravos Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Azores Bravos Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>2 e 3 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> na deslumbrante <strong>Ilha Terceira<\/strong>, nos <strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Ilha Terceira (AAIT)<\/strong> em estreita parceria com o Governo Regional dos A\u00e7ores e os Munic\u00edpios de Angra do Hero\u00edsmo e Praia da Vit\u00f3ria, o evento desafia os atletas com percursos lineares que cruzam a imponente orografia vulc\u00e2nica da ilha at\u00e9 \u00e0 emblem\u00e1tica meta na <strong>Pra\u00e7a Velha, em Angra do Hero\u00edsmo<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes escolher entre cinco desafios de pura supera\u00e7\u00e3o em montanha: o \u00e9pico <strong>AzBT 100K<\/strong> (100,2 km com +3968m D+, partida no Miradouro do Facho \u00e0 meia-noite), o exigente <strong>AzBT 50K<\/strong> (51,8 km e +2068m D+, partida na Agualva \u00e0s 08:00), o vibrante <strong>AzBT 35K<\/strong> (35,2 km e +1599m D+, partida nos Biscoitos \u00e0s 10:00), o r\u00e1pido <strong>AzBT 15K<\/strong> (15,5 km e +677m D+, partida no Posto Santo \u00e0s 11:30) e a magn\u00edfica <strong>Caminhada de 10,1 km<\/strong> (+349m D+). Todas as provas atribuem pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para o Circuito de Trail da Ilha Terceira, Circuito Nacional da ATRP, ITRA National League e UTMB Index.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura transporte em autocarro para todas as zonas de partida, rigoroso controlo por geolocaliza\u00e7\u00e3o e chip, postos de abastecimento completos e medalha de finalista no cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico de Angra do Hero\u00edsmo.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; ba