"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Azores Bravos Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre nos dias 2 e 3 de outubro de 2026 na Ilha Terceira, A\u00e7ores, com secretariado e meta comum instalados na Pra\u00e7a Velha, em Angra do Hero\u00edsmo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas partem a 3 de outubro: AzBT 100K \u00e0s 00:00 (Miradouro do Facho, Praia da Vit\u00f3ria), AzBT 50K \u00e0s 08:00 (Agualva), AzBT 35K \u00e0s 10:00 (Biscoitos), AzBT 15K \u00e0s 11:30 (Posto Santo) e Caminhada 10K \u00e0s 11:45 (Posto Santo).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As provas conferem pontos e certifica\u00e7\u00f5es internacionais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, as provas competitivas integram o Circuito Nacional da ATRP 2026\/27, o Circuito de Trail da Ilha Terceira, conferem pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para a ITRA National League e indexa\u00e7\u00e3o para o circuito UTMB.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o transporte para os locais de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza servi\u00e7o de autocarro a partir de Angra do Hero\u00edsmo (Cerrado do Bail\u00e3o) e Praia da Vit\u00f3ria (Hotel Praia Marina) para todos os pontos de partida das diferentes dist\u00e2ncias.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial integral est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta e download na plataforma Stop and Go em https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/azores-bravos-trail-2026\/rules.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Azores Bravos Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-02\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a Velha, Angra do Hero\u00edsmo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Angra do Hero\u00edsmo\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Ilha Terceira (AAIT)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Azores Bravos Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre nos dias 2 e 3 de outubro de 2026 na Ilha Terceira, A\u00e7ores, com secretariado e meta comum instalados na Pra\u00e7a Velha, em Angra do Hero\u00edsmo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As provas partem a 3 de outubro: AzBT 100K \u00e0s 00:00 (Miradouro do Facho, Praia da Vit\u00f3ria), AzBT 50K \u00e0s 08:00 (Agualva), AzBT 35K \u00e0s 10:00 (Biscoitos), AzBT 15K \u00e0s 11:30 (Posto Santo) e Caminhada 10K \u00e0s 11:45 (Posto Santo).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"As provas conferem pontos e certifica\u00e7\u00f5es internacionais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, as provas competitivas integram o Circuito Nacional da ATRP 2026\/27, o Circuito de Trail da Ilha Terceira, conferem pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para a ITRA National League e indexa\u00e7\u00e3o para o 